#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/009/FesVlt2026Entrance_00938:TEXT_FESVLT2026ENTRANCE_00938_SYSTEM_000_042:1"
msgid "The duty action <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Bake: Off</ui-edge-color></ui-color> can only be used when your hands are free and unencumbered by ingredients. It will temporarily render any mammet within range unable to move."
msgstr "Действие задания <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Стоп-сигнал</ui-edge-color></ui-color> можно использовать, только если руки свободны и вы не несёте ингредиенты. Оно ненадолго обездвижит всех манекенов поблизости."
